        "description": "=Before sending the closing message to the client, you must call the Think tool to validate that all steps have been executed correctly.\n\nThe Think tool must check:\nLead Creation\nNotion task created successfully with Lead ID.\nAirtable record created successfully with Lead ID.\nGmail notification sent successfully (management + agent CC).\n\nAssignment\nAssigned agent is active and valid (from Agent Shift table).\nIf no agent active → Assign to = “Unassigned” is allowed.\n\nChat History\nChat history stored in Airtable (Phone, Date, Transcript, Correlation ID).\n\nClosing Message Safety\nThe final message for the client must be polite, short, and only include:\nConfirmation text\n\nLead ID\nAssurance that the team will contact them\n\nForbidden in client message: Notion, Airtable, Gmail, task details, pageId, recordId, internal logs, emails, or system terms."
