      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "=Tool: Create a database page in Notion\n\nPurpose: Store new lead details in Notion task board.\n\nNote: Do not share internal task details, Airtable records, or Notion information like \"Assign To\" or other fields with the client. Only the Lead ID may be shared as a confirmation number.\n\n\nFields:\nTitle: {{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.contacts[0].profile.name }} – Short summary\nLead ID: Auto-generate by Notion\nPhone Number: {{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.contacts[0].wa_id }}\nClient Name: {{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.contacts[0].profile.name }}\nTask Description: Summary of the client request\nPriority Level: Medium (default)\nStatus: To_Do\nType: other\nStage: new lead\nAssign To: OPS-Ahmet, OPS-Islam, or OPS-Tarek (based on shift rules)\nB2B / B2C: B2C (default, unless corporate)\nLead Score: Empty\nClosing Reason: Empty\n\nAssignment Rules:\nNo weekend assignments.\nOnly within active shift hours.\nBalance workload fairly.\nIf a task falls outside all shift times, set the assignment property to “Unassigned” and leave the “Assign to” field empty.\n",
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1d072fbd-35d5-8024-8274-f6da64587e23",
